From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ivo Nunes <ivo@nunes.uk>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 11:49:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Credit Purr in the About dialog

The About dialog now opens with "Purr by NekoLab, based on Godot
Engine." above Godot's own copyright lines, which stay as they are.
The line is plain text rather than a translatable string, since it's a
name and isn't in Godot's translation catalogues.

Test: open Help > About; the first line is "Purr by NekoLab, based on
Godot Engine."

Not for upstream. Policy: https://godotengine.org/trademark/
---
 godot/editor/gui/editor_about.cpp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/godot/editor/gui/editor_about.cpp b/godot/editor/gui/editor_about.cpp
index 708bf0f0..7c32637d 100644
--- a/godot/editor/gui/editor_about.cpp
+++ b/godot/editor/gui/editor_about.cpp
@@ -57,6 +57,7 @@ void EditorAbout::_notification(int p_what) {
 	switch (p_what) {
 		case NOTIFICATION_TRANSLATION_CHANGED: {
 			_about_text_label->set_text(
+					String("Purr by NekoLab, based on Godot Engine.\n\n") +
 					String(U"© 2014-present ") + TTR("Godot Engine contributors") + ".\n" +
 					String(U"© 2007-2014 Juan Linietsky, Ariel Manzur.\n"));
 
